    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a fair point about the balancing act. But honestly, some of the folks in my town council are arguing that these increases are basically a death sentence for local shops, while others say it's about time workers got a decent living. From a business consulting perspective, which side actually has the more realistic view of what happens to the local economy in the long run?",
