    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I get that it depends on the rate of increase, but it feels like you're kind of downplaying the immediate reality for owners like me. If I have to hike my prices just to stay afloat, I'm worried I'll just lose my regulars to the big chains that can absorb these costs much easier. Isn't it true that these policies disproportionately hurt the small, local players compared to the big corporations?",
